{'symbol': 'CMI', 'date': '2023-03-15 13:00:00', 'title': 'CUMMINS ANNOUNCES MARY CHANDLER RETIRING AFTER SERVING CUMMINS AND ITS GLOBAL COMMUNITIES SINCE 2011', 'text': 'COLUMBUS, IND.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #CUMMINS--TODAY, CUMMINS INC. (NYSE: CMI) ANNOUNCED THAT MARY CHANDLER, VICE PRESIDENT – CORPORATE RESPONSIBILITY AND COMMUNITY RELATIONS AND CEO OF THE CUMMINS FOUNDATION, IS RETIRING LATER THIS SPRING AND JIM SCHACHT, CURRENTLY A MEMBER OF THE CORPORATE RESPONSIBILITY LEADERSHIP TEAM, WILL SUCCEED MARY AND BE PROMOTED TO VICE PRESIDENT OF CUMMINS.'}